		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.comment</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Su Gachu Health Sync — SKELETON (best-effort import).

This imports the config + network call only. You MUST add the Health actions
yourself following docs/apple-health-shortcut.md:
  1. Edit the two Text actions below (INGEST_URL, TOKEN) with the values from
     the app: Profile - Conecteaza Apple Watch.
  2. Between them and the Dictionary, add "Find Health Samples" +
     "Calculate Statistics" for each metric, and the Sleep Analysis repeat loop.
  3. Fill the "days" array in the Dictionary with your day dictionary.
Then re-share your own iCloud link.</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionIdentifier</key>
			<string>is.workflow.actions.gettext</string>
			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>UUID</key>
				<string>A1000000-0000-0000-0000-0000000000URL</string>
				<key>CustomOutputName</key>
				<string>INGEST_URL</string>
				<key>WFTextActionText</key>
				<string>PASTE_INGEST_URL_HERE</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
