			<key>WFWorkflowActionParameters</key>
			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>=== ADD HEALTH ACTIONS HERE ===
Find Health Samples (Steps, Active Energy, Apple Exercise Time, Resting Heart
Rate, Heart Rate avg/min/max, HRV SDNN, VO2 Max, Respiratory Rate, Blood Oxygen,
Body Mass) filtered to today + Calculate Statistics.
Then Sleep Analysis over (yesterday 18:00 .. today 12:00) with a Repeat loop
that sums core/deep/rem/awake minutes. See docs/apple-health-shortcut.md.
Store the assembled day dictionary in a variable named DayDict.</string>
			</dict>
